WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.523 --> 00:00:05.830
The basemap menu gathers the basemap, the overlays and the opacity.

2
00:00:06.829 --> 00:00:12.680
The slider sets the map over the aerial photo: here up to eighty percent, then back to thirty.

3
00:00:16.285 --> 00:00:20.732
The vertical bar tilts the view: the terrain appears, with its hillshading.
